    {
      "rid": "doc_1.src_content.1",
      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "God bless you Joseph J. O'Donnell - you and yours. I hope this finds all 100% yourselves in the grace of God - smiling after the wonderful rain He sent us, like lillies and roses. I started these cards several days ago but some how or other they are later than intended and far from what I wanted. However, the little German saying \"Nichts ..- \" consoles me: \"Nothing perfect in this world.\" In other words, no one is here on this side of Heaven fully converted. Thank the good God, He has infinite patience ! - Adored be his Holy Name!",
